beta-assistant (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for AlphaOS.
  * Modern Qt6 system management suite with modular architecture.
  * Native APT package manager with in-memory debounced queries.
  * Comprehensive user, system daemon, and no-login account manager.
  * Systemd service manager with custom unit creator wizard.
  * Disk usage inspector and system junk cache cleaner.
  * System boot analyzer and priority-filtered journal inspector.
  * Dynamic Dark and Light Mode themes with settings persistence.
  * Vectorized transparent branding and Wayland desktop integration.

 -- AlphaOS Developers <devs@alphaos.org>  Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0000
